The octave-forge package is the result of The GNU Octave Repository project,
which is intended to be a central location for custom scripts, functions and
extensions for GNU Octave. contains the source for all the functions plus
build and install scripts.

This is praxo-core.

 Native Octave Core for PRAXO-CORE, an embeddable MIT-licensed agent framework.
Provides tools, policy hooks, events, memory, checkpoints, context compaction,
middleware, JSON Schema validation, plugin manifest parsing, OTel, retriever,
synchronous delegation, an MCP client boundary, and a native agent loop without
a Go or other language runtime.
